  "key": "pr-1115",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "chore(factory): pin dmtools-agents @9bea0f9 — chore:pin lane guard + human-push un-park",
    "description": "Cumulative factory pin cee5996 → 9bea0f9, two live-verified fixes (dmtools-agents #583 + #584, merged by keeper-6 on the owner's sub-chain authority):\n\n- **chore:pin lane guard (#583)**: review protocol now pins the lane as trusted + non-exclusive — review legs never strip chore:pin from other PRs (live bug: fa #1104's release bump lost the label at 13:31:08Z when the #1105 review leg 'deduped' the lane; v1.0.494 stranded behind the guest FIFO until the keeper fast-tracked it).\n- **human-push un-park (#584)**: validation_failed clears only on a HUMAN push newer than the park event; machine pushes (silent-updates, agent WIP auto-saves) hold the park (live bug: fa #1094 churned arm→red→re-arm 13:40–15:10Z, stealing the validate-armed mutex from the release/pin queue).\n\n3 stubs bumped in lockstep (machine-sm / ai-teammate / machine-merge), factory_stub_ref_test.dart green (7/7). Closes the churn until the next cumulative pin."
  }
}

